# deploy/searxng/.env — local development only (git ignores .env); docker-compose.yml reads it.
# On Railway set SEARXNG_SECRET as a variable of the searxng service instead (docs/deploy.md §2.6).
#
# SEARXNG_SECRET: SearXNG's secret key, a long random string, for example the output of
#   python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(48))"
# The service refuses to start without it. Only SearXNG uses it; the API and worker never need it.
SEARXNG_SECRET=
